---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Seoyedoum | 서예를 위한 작은 도구" lang="ko">
  <main class="home">
    <div class="content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">SEOYEDOUM · 서예 도우미</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">글을 세고,<br /><span>종이 위에 그려보세요.</span></h1>
          <p class="description">서예 작업을 시작하기 전 필요한 두 가지를 한곳에 담았습니다. 원고의 글자 수를 확인하고, 종이 위의 배치를 미리 살펴보세요.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="action primary" href="/count/">글자 수 세기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="action secondary" href="/layout/">글자 배치하기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="art-label">원고에서 종이까지</div>
          <div class="sheet-back"></div>
          <div class="sheet">
            <div class="sheet-writing">한 글자씩<br />마음을 담아<br />천천히 쓰다</div>
            <div class="seal-mark">서예</div>
          </div>
          <div class="art-size">70 × 135 cm</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tools" aria-label="서예 도구">
        <a class="tool-card" href="/count/">
          <span class="tool-number">01 / 글 준비</span>
          <span class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">한</span>
          <h2>글자 수 세기</h2>
          <p>공백 포함·제외 글자 수와 단어 수를 바로 확인하세요. 원고의 분량을 가늠할 수 있습니다.</p>
          <span class="tool-link">도구 열기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="tool-card" href="/layout/">
          <span class="tool-number">02 / 배치 구상</span>
          <span class="tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>
          <h2>글자 배치</h2>
          <p>용지 크기와 열 수, 여백을 조절하며 세로쓰기 배치를 살펴보고 PNG로 저장하세요.</p>
          <span class="tool-link">도구 열기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .home { min-height: 100%; background: #17191d; color: #f5f3ed; }
  .content { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 0 80px; }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(300px, .9fr); align-items: center; gap: 48px; min-height: 390px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 20px; color: #c9aa75; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.17; }
  h1 span { color: #cbb186; }
  .description { max-width: 560px; margin: 26px 0 32px; color: #aaa9a5; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; word-break: keep-all; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .action { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 22px; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s, transform .2s; }
  .action:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .action.primary { background: #d5b989; color: #201d18; }
  .action.primary:hover { background: #e8cda0; }
  .action.secondary { background: #30333a; color: #f5f3ed; }
  .action.secondary:hover { background: #40444d; }
  .action:focus-visible, .tool-card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #e8cda0; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .hero-art { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 390px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-art::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 360px; height: 360px; border-radius: 50%; background: #97856a24; filter: blur(55px); }
  .art-label, .art-size { position: absolute; z-index: 2; color: #858580; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .art-label { top: 26px; left: 12%; }
  .art-size { right: 10%; bottom: 26px; }
  .sheet-back, .sheet { width: 210px; height: 320px; border-radius: 2px; }
  .sheet-back { position: absolute; background: #9a8b71; transform: rotate(9deg) translate(18px, 8px); opacity: .55; }
  .sheet { position: relative; padding: 30px 26px; background: #f4f0e5; box-shadow: 0 24px 50px #0007; transform: rotate(-5deg); }
  .sheet::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 18px; border: 1px solid #b4a58b55; }
  .sheet-writing { position: relative; height: 100%; margin-left: auto; color: #24231e; font-family: 'sj_lck', '이철경체', 'Batang', 'AppleMyungjo', serif; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: .18em; line-height: 1.7; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .seal-mark { position: absolute; left: 30px; bottom: 30px; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 31px; height: 31px; border: 2px solid #a54136; color: #a54136; font-family: serif; font-size: 10px; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .tool-card { position: relative; min-height: 236px; padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #ffffff13; border-radius: 14px; background: #22252a; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s, background .2s; }
  .tool-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: #d5b9897a; background: #282c32; }
  .tool-number { color: #aa916d; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .tool-icon { position: absolute; top: 25px; right: 28px; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 39px; height: 39px; border-radius: 8px; background: #36383b; color: #d5b989; font-family: serif; font-size: 23px; }
  .tool-card h2 { margin: 37px 0 10px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; }
  .tool-card p { max-width: 440px; margin: 0; color: #a7a7a5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; word-break: keep-all; }
  .tool-link { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 25px; color: #d5b989; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .content { padding-top: 42px; } .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; } .hero-art { min-height: 330px; } .sheet-back, .sheet { width: 180px; height: 276px; } .sheet-writing { font-size: 22px; } .tools { margin-top: 22px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .content { width: min(100% - 32px, 480px); padding-bottom: 40px; } .description { font-size: 15px; } .tools { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .tool-card { min-height: 216px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .action, .tool-card { transition: none; } }
</style>
